# Raw NotebookLM material (not checked in)
docs/_notebooklm_excerpts/

# Per-deployment rule schedule state (written by GUI/scheduler at runtime —
# same category as config.json / alerts.json which are also gitignored).
config/rule_schedules.json

# Session handoff notes — local context only, may contain test-lab creds
.session-handoff-*.md

# UX review raw screenshots (large binaries, may contain internal hostnames/IPs)
docs/ux-review-*/screenshots/

# Limiter runtime snapshot state (auto-created by GUI rate limiter)
config/limiter/
docs/ux-review-2026-05-14/

# Cross-process advisory lock files (src/file_lock.py). Zero-length; flock
# only needs the fd, not any content. The OS releases the lock on process
# death, so these are never unlinked.
*.lock
# 但相依鎖檔一定要進版控：requirements.lock 是 2026-07 之前就 tracked 才逃過
# 上面這條，新增的 requirements-offline.lock 沒有這道豁免，漏了就會靜靜地不進
# repo，CI 與離線建置都拿不到鎖檔。
!requirements*.lock

# Local tool caches — CodeGraph index and Playwright MCP scratch output.
.codegraph/
.playwright-mcp/
